# HUB-FITNESS (always)

Full canon: `hub-fitness.md` at repo root. Read it when shipping or touching schema/Worker.

## Ship — do not accumulate

When work lands in a session / PR, **close the loop**:

1. **git** — commit + push (+ merge to `main` if on a branch)
2. **Railway** — deploy the **new** commit (fresh build; not old-build redeploy alone)
3. **Wrangler** — if `workers/hub-fitness-proxy/**` changed → `cd workers/hub-fitness-proxy && npm run deploy`
4. **Supabase** — if `supabase/migrations/**` changed → apply on Operator remote **same delivery** (keep file + remote in sync)

Forbidden: push without Wrangler when Worker changed; migration only in git or only remote; stacking shippable work “for later”.

## Hard locks

- CAPEX R$ 207.300 — no invent
- Ad Valorem 0.10% on **service NF only**
- No `tenant_id` on Client DB (ADR-003)
- RFQ `APPROVE` blocked without unit/landed
- Score = heuristic label, never “IA confidence”

